  "body": "We probably need to update our docsy template. Thankfully, the GHA workflow is [pinned](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/fbb8a789f605a304e53b79e96b700b7f154aafcd/.github/workflows/main.yml#L150).\r\n\r\nTested with v0.111.3, v0.112.0, and v0.112.3 and all 3 don't *fully* build the TOC. Confirmed fixed with our pinned version (v0.93.3).\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n![image](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/assets/1190097/d09d590c-61db-4370-947b-10e9ef1d8b6f)\r\n\r\nIt's missing all the other APIs, the changelog page, etc. \r\n\r\nI suspect [this check](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/fbb8a789f605a304e53b79e96b700b7f154aafcd/layouts/partials/sidebar-tree.html#L36) in sidebar-tree is responsible, and has changed sometime between 0.93.3 and now. The parent partial, `sidebar.html`, is *not* falling into its cache condition.",
